# The short GIF on tags: give a file a colour from the menu, see its dot, then open the list
# of that colour from the sidebar.
Set Framerate 15
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/tag.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --demo main ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Show
Sleep 800ms
Down 14
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+K
Sleep 1s
Down 6
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Down 4
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Tab
Down 14
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
